# ===========================================================================
# URL ingestion
#
# This is DIFFERENT from WebResearchAgent.
#
# /documents/url permanently adds a website to the knowledge base.
#
# WebResearchAgent temporarily researches websites and does NOT store them
# in Pinecone automatically.
